    {
      "rank": 12,
      "row_id": 371358,
      "chunk_id": "423246965a3a_0",
      "doc_id": "423246965a3a",
      "text": "Check for SIM card before trying to activate.. I love the phone as expected. Upgrading from a pixel 3a because I wanted the wireless charging and regretted not getting the XL. I have Google FI and it's usually very simple to activate and I couldn't get this phone to do it because it was set on the Verizon network. I couldn't get it to switch networks. For Google FI you don't need a SIM but I had one laying around and decided to try that and then found the Verizon SIM had come installed in the phone. After removing that it activated easily and I'm happy with my choice .",
      "score": 0.03468794938165085,
