    {
      "rank": 14,
      "row_id": 261229,
      "chunk_id": "7a3db6994a9f_1",
      "doc_id": "7a3db6994a9f",
      "text": "So I did a factory reset then re-added my account. As soon as I did that I got a notification that my device was unlocked for use on any carrier! I popped the Visible sim back in a had full voice, texting, and data. So, my advice to anyone who buys one of these would be to do a full factory reset after updating to Android 10 before popping your sim in. Otherwise, the phone is excellent. The speed and camera are still excellent despite being a year old.",
